        "original_id": "c8216a4f-619a-5e9a-ac5c-7e205ebeaf6d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins, New England Patriots, Indianapolis Colts\n- Seasons: 1978 Miami Dolphins season, 2004 New England Patriots season, 2005 Indianapolis Colts season\n- Organizations: National Football League\n- Topics: playoffs, records, team seasons\n\nFacts:\n- The 1978 Miami Dolphins season ended with the Miami Dolphins returning to the NFL playoffs for the first time since 1974 and finishing with an 11–5 record.\n- A record associated with the 1978 Miami Dolphins season was equalled by the 2004 New England Patriots.\n- Another record associated with the 1978 Miami Dolphins season was broken by the 2005 Indianapolis Colts.\n- The 2004 New England Patriots season was the franchise's 35th season in the National Football League and its 45th season overall.",
